<title>USA: UtiliMED to service Medica Health Plans.</title>
<headline>UtiliMED to service Medica Health Plans.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UltiMED Inc, a manager of diagnostics imaging services, said it signed a 25-month agreement with Minneapolis-based Medica Health Plans, a subsidiary of Allina Health System, to provide services aimed at improving the quality of diagnostic imaging.</p>
<p>The agreement will run from December 1, 1996 through December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
